{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 80,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "Hear us, Shepherd of Israel, lead Joseph like a flock, the cherubim, shine out.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "领如领羊群之的牧者啊，求你留心听！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "領如領羊群之的牧者啊，求你留心聽！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "Before Ephraim, Benjamin, and Manasseh, stir up your might! Come to save us!",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "在、、前面",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "在、、前面",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "Turn us again, God. your face to shine, and we will be saved.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神啊，求你使我们回转，",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "- 80:3 或译：复兴"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝啊，求你使我們回轉，",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "- 80:3 或譯：復興"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "LORD God of Armies, long will you be angry against the prayer of your people?",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华—万军之 神啊，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華－萬軍之上帝啊，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "You have fed them with the bread of tears, and given them tears to drink in large measure.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你以眼泪当食物给他们吃，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你以眼淚當食物給他們吃，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "You make us a source of contention to our neighbors. Our enemies laugh among themselves.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你使邻邦因我们纷争；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你使鄰邦因我們紛爭；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "Turn us again, God of Armies. your face to shine, and we will be saved.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "万军之 神啊，求你使我们回转，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "萬軍之上帝啊，求你使我們回轉，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "You brought a vine out of Egypt. You drove out the nations, and planted it.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你从挪出一棵葡萄树，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你從挪出一棵葡萄樹，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "You cleared the ground for it. It took deep root, and filled the land.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你在这树根前预备了，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你在這樹根前預備了，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "The mountains were covered with its shadow. Its boughs were like God’s cedars.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "它的影子遮满了山，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "它的影子遮滿了山，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "It sent out its branches to the sea, its shoots to the River.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "它发出枝子，长到大海，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "它發出枝子，長到大海，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "12",
      "en": {
        "text": "Why have you broken down its walls, so that all those who pass by the way pluck it?",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你为何拆毁这树的篱笆，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你為何拆毀這樹的籬笆，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "13",
      "en": {
        "text": "The boar out of the wood ravages it. The wild animals of the field feed on it.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "林中出来的野猪把它糟踏；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "林中出來的野豬把它糟踏；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "14",
      "en": {
        "text": "Turn again, we beg you, God of Armies. from heaven, and see, and visit this vine,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "万军之 神啊，求你回转！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "萬軍之上帝啊，求你回轉！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "15",
      "en": {
        "text": "the stock which your right hand planted, the branch that you made strong for yourself.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "保护你右手所栽的",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "保護你右手所栽的",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "16",
      "en": {
        "text": "It’s burned with fire. It’s cut down. They perish at your rebuke.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "这树已经被火焚烧，被刀砍伐；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "這樹已經被火焚燒，被刀砍伐；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "17",
      "en": {
        "text": "Let your hand be on the man of your right hand, on the son of man whom you made strong for yourself.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "愿你的手扶持你右边的人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "願你的手扶持你右邊的人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "18",
      "en": {
        "text": "So we will not turn away from you. us, and we will call on your name.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "这样，我们便不退后离开你；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "這樣，我們便不退後離開你；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "19",
      "en": {
        "text": "Turn us again, LORD God of Armies. Cause your face to shine, and we will be saved.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华—万军之 神啊，求你使我们回转，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華－萬軍之上帝啊，求你使我們回轉，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}